+/*
+ * OmniVision OV08A10 image sensor driver
+ *
+ * Register settings come from the OnePlus 9 Pro telephoto module data
+ * (com.qti.sensormodule.lemonadep.qtech_ov08a10.bin): 3264x2448 at 30 fps
+ * over two MIPI D-PHY lanes at 1.6 Gbps.
+ */
+
